WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.417
An equation says two quantities are equal. Use inverse operations to solve for the

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:05.789
unknown.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:14.766
Solve x plus 17 equals 41. The answer is 24. x equals 41 minus 17 equals 24.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:20.651
A box at a science exhibition has 8 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 18.

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:23.169
What is x? Pause the video and think.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:29.472
A box at a science exhibition has 8 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 18.

00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:34.231
What is x? The answer is 10. x equals 18 minus 8 equals 10.
